        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present to the market this wonderful 3-bedroom detached family home with a sunny south facing rear garden sitting on 3.88 acres at Calliaghstown Lower, Rathcoole. Calliaghstown Lower is located just off the Kilteel Road & a short drive back down into Rathcoole Village which has every conceivable amenity including local bars, shops, schools, Avoca and Rathcoole Park. Transport wise, there is a host of local bus routes and easy access to the N7 and M50 road networks.\r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c 139 sqm can be found spread over two floors in this immaculately presented property, and in brief comprises of entrance hallway, large living room with stove fireplace, fully fitted kitchen/dining area, two double bedrooms with ensuite bathroom and main family bathroom. There is a downstairs level to the house with another large family room with main bathroom and double bedroom.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property you have a beautifully maintained garden with a sunny south west facing orientation with stunning views, it is also further benefitted by having a covered decking area which allows you to sit out all year round. There is ample amounts of parking space to the front of the property. This home also has a beautiful block-built unit to the side which can be used for so many different purposes.\r\n\r\nAs this home is sitting on a large site the scope for further development down the road is endless & the house itself comes to the market in truly fantastic condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years and further benefits from oil fired central heating, spacious living, two living areas, fully fitted kitchen and top-quality fixtures and fittings to name but a few. We expect this property to be extremely popular with people looking to upsize and settle roots in a country & scenic setting with endless scope for potential.\r\n\r\nViewing is advised to not miss out on this fantastic home. Call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for more information.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n- D2 Energy Rating\r\n- c 139 sqm\r\n- 3 bed / 3 bath\r\n- Detached family home\r\n- Sitting on 3.88 acres\r\n- Fantastic condition throughout\r\n- No expense spared by current owners when upgrading\r\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom\r\n- Beautiful rear garden\r\n- Stunning scenic views\r\n- Beautiful countryside setting\r\n- Sunny south west facing orientation\r\n- Perfect for relaxing on sunny summer evenings\r\n- Covered decking area\r\n- Entrance hallway\r\n- Two living rooms with stoves\r\n- Fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Open plan kitchen/dining area\r\n- Three generous bedrooms\r\n- Two master ensuites\r\n- Fitted wardrobes\r\n- Main family bathroom\r\n- Top quality fittings\r\n- Top quality flooring\r\n- Double glazed windows\r\n- Ample parking\r\n- Oil fired central heating\r\n- Block built unit to the side\r\n- Can be used for so many different purposes\r\n- Short drive to Rathcoole Village\r\n- Kilteel close by\r\n- Viewing highly advised\r\n\r\nDirections - D24XD70"
      },
